"theory_topic_spacing_citation" = "Nicholas J. Cepeda, Harold Pashler, Edward Vul, John T. Wixted kaj Doug Rohrer. Distributed Practice in Verbal Recall Tasks: A Review and Quantitative Synthesis. Psychological Bulletin, 2006, 132(3), 354–380.";
